// ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
// ┃  ZMK Corne Configuration                 ┃
// ┣━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┫
// ┃  ajpemok                                 ┃
// ┃  Corne 42 Key Layout                     ┃
// ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║  Configuration Variables Reference       ║
// ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
// ║  defines the timing and toggle knobs     ║
// ║  used across hold-taps and mod-morphs    ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

// ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │  This section defines exactly how ZMK    │
// │  resolves dual-function behaviours.      │
// │                                          │
// │  Timers (Milliseconds):                  │
// │  - tapping-term-ms: The primary timer.   │
// │    Releasing before this sends a tap.    │
// │    Holding beyond this sends a hold.     │
// │  - quick-tap-ms: The double-tap window.  │
// │    If tapped again within this time, it  │
// │    repeats the tap instead of holding.   │
// │  - require-prior-idle-ms: The typing     │
// │    buffer. A hold is only allowed if     │
// │    no other keys were pressed recently.  │
// │                                          │
// │  Flavours (Resolution Strategy):         │
// │  - hold-preferred: The instant another   │
// │    key is pressed, it becomes a hold.    │
// │  - tap-preferred: Prioritises typing.    │
// │    It remains a tap if released before   │
// │    the term, even if another key fires.  │
// │  - balanced: The home-row sweet spot.    │
// │    It becomes a hold if another key is   │
// │    pressed AND released while held.      │
// │                                          │
// │  Modifiers and Conditions:               │
// │  - hold-trigger-on-release: Pauses the   │
// │    flavour logic until you let go of     │
// │    the key, preventing accidental mods   │
// │    during fast, sloppy typing rolls.     │
// │  - hold-trigger-key-positions: Cross     │
// │    hand blocking. The modifier only      │
// │    works if the next key pressed is on   │
// │    the opposite side of the keyboard.    │
// │  - retro-tap: If you hold the key past   │
// │    the term but never press another      │
// │    key, it sends the tap action anyway.  │
// └──────────────────────────────────────────┘

/ {
    behaviors {
        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Home Row Mod Left                       ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 175ms                  ║
        // ║  quick-tap-ms: 150ms                     ║
        // ║  require-prior-idle-ms: 150ms            ║
        // ║  flavor: balanced                        ║
        // ║  hold-trigger-key-positions: right hand  ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        mt_home_row_mod_left: home_row_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOME_ROW_MOD_LEFT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <6 18 30 40 39 41 35 23 11 10 18 19 20 21 22 30 31 32 33 34 7 8 9>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Home Row Mod Right                      ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 175ms                  ║
        // ║  quick-tap-ms: 150ms                     ║
        // ║  require-prior-idle-ms: 150ms            ║
        // ║  flavor: balanced                        ║
        // ║  hold-trigger-key-positions: left hand   ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        mt_home_row_mod_right: home_row_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOME_ROW_MOD_RIGHT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-on-release;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 5 12 13 14 15 16 17 24 25 26 27 28 29 36 37 38>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Custom Layer Tap                        ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 150ms                  ║
        // ║  quick-tap-ms: 125ms                     ║
        // ║  flavor: balanced                        ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        custom_layer_tap: custom_layer_tap {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_LAYER_TAP";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Mod-Morphs                              ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  context-aware keys for symbols and      ║
        // ║  navigation utility                      ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        mm_escape_grave: mm_escape_grave {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ESCAPE_GRAVE";
            bindings = <&kp ESC>, <&kp GRAVE>;
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_backspace_del: mm_backspace_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_BACKSPACE_DEL";
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DEL>;
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim: mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ROUND_BRACKET_LEFT_EXCLAIM";
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp EXCLAMATION>;
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim: mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ROUND_BRACKET_RIGHT_EXCLAIM";
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp EXCLAMATION>;
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Tap-Dances                              ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 175ms (hyper/meh)      ║
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 200ms (caps lock)      ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        td_hyper_meh: td_hyper_meh {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_HYPER_MEH";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(LG(LSHFT)))>, <&kp LA(LC(LSHFT))>;
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        td_meh_hyper: td_meh_hyper {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_MEH_HYPER";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(LSHFT))>, <&kp LA(LC(LG(LSHFT)))>;
            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        td_caps_word_lock: td_caps_word_lock {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_CAPS_WORD_LOCK";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&caps_word>, <&kp CAPSLOCK>;
        };
        
        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Custom Hold Tap                         ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 150ms                  ║
        // ║  quick-tap-ms: 125ms                     ║
        // ║  flavor: tap-preferred                   ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        custom_hold_tap: custom_hold_tap {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_HOLD_TAP";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  Custom Hold Tap Retro                   ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  tapping-term-ms: 150ms                  ║
        // ║  quick-tap-ms: 125ms                     ║
        // ║  flavor: tap-preferred                   ║
        // ║  retro-tap: enabled                      ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        custom_hold_tap_retro: custom_hold_tap_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CUSTOM_HOLD_TAP_RETRO";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            retro-tap;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";
        combo_jk_backspace {
            bindings = <&kp DEL>;
            key-positions = <19 20>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        main {
            label = "main";
            bindings = <
&mm_escape_grave         &kp Q                            &kp W                            &kp E                         &kp R                         &kp T          &kp Y          &kp U                             &kp I                         &kp O                            &kp P                                    &kp MINUS
&custom_layer_tap 2 TAB  &home_row_mod_left LEFT_GUI A    &home_row_mod_left LEFT_ALT S    &home_row_mod_left LCTRL D    &home_row_mod_left LSHFT F    &kp G          &kp H          &home_row_mod_right RIGHT_SHIFT J &home_row_mod_right RCTRL K    &home_row_mod_right RIGHT_ALT L  &home_row_mod_right RIGHT_GUI SEMICOLON  &kp SQT
&mt LSHFT ENTER          &kp Z                            &kp X                            &kp C                         &kp V                         &kp B          &kp N          &kp M                             &kp COMMA                     &kp DOT                          &kp SLASH                                &kp ENTER
                                                                                                                         &td_meh_hyper                 &td_hyper_meh  &custom_layer_tap 2 SPACE         &custom_layer_tap 2 SPACE     &custom_layer_tap 1 BACKSPACE    &custom_layer_tap 2 DELETE
            >;
        };

        movement {
            label = "movement";
            bindings = <
&kp GRAVE  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN  &kp UP  &kp RIGHT  &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans  &trans
                           &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        number {
            label = "number";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9              &kp ASTRK  &kp LBKT                        &kp RBKT
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6              &kp MINUS  &mm_round_bracket_left_exclaim  &mm_round_bracket_right_exclaim
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3              &kp PLUS   &kp FSLH                        &kp BSLH
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &kp N0  &mt RSHFT KP_EQUAL
            >;
        };

        transition {
            label = "transition";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &sl 4     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        io {
            label = "io";
            bindings = <
&trans  &bt BT_DISC 0  &bt BT_DISC 1  &bt BT_DISC 2  &bt BT_DISC 3  &bt BT_DISC 4    &out OUT_TOG  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &bt BT_CLR
&trans  &bt BT_SEL 0   &bt BT_SEL 1   &bt BT_SEL 2   &bt BT_SEL 3   &bt BT_SEL 4     &trans        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans           &trans        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                      &trans         &trans         &trans           &trans        &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";
        tri_layer {
            if-layers = <1 2>;
            then-layer = <3>;
        };
    };
};
